{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fd59f6adbb19dc18a03c0698c6025119d9d40cbe726658cb7e106a7f6cd92451","ja":"家族参観ライブ！","zh":"家人参观演唱会！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"43175d0467c631cec51f743f7f0c2527b4c5f298e3780a9bfef932806a4d0397","ja":"そして、家族に見守られながらの、\n4人のゲリラライブが始まった……","zh":"然后，在身旁家人的注视下，\n4个人的游击演唱会开始了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"933e5e3eb4656806551fda6be7bb9ff96f3773c58cb8482ee21542624c70572d","ja":"次もめっちゃテンション高い曲やで～！\nみんな、声出してな～！","zh":"下一首也是超嗨的歌哦～！\n大家，都要喊出来啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a7dd60df779411c9a187b83b59fff11c6a7c1b274dcd1a9f28592af84e306b85","ja":"前のほう、もっと声出せるよな～！？\nほら、そこの最前列の人たち！　もっと声張って！","zh":"前面的，还能喊得更大声吧～！？\n喂，那边的前排观众！声音再大一点！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1573d5085a8d1a408350b56791b61b431a5d385db11ff8f487a2c2508c2f36e4","ja":"「うおおぉぉっ！」「瑞希ちゃーん！」\n「雪歩ちゃん頑張って～！」「みんな可愛いよ～！」","zh":"“喔喔喔喔！”“瑞希——！”\n“雪步要加油啊～！”“大家都很可爱哦～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a4e68a4f1f92d6aaf54374360050ed173afc8a2ab09c5119b369c52e0fa2942e","ja":"へへっ！　その調子！\nもっともっと、盛り上がっていこうぜ！","zh":"嘿嘿！就是这个节奏！\n更加更加热烈地嗨起来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9c71be3874d3b6c575de57e6be7842d203d6e0287e9a241dbd93ce7665ee256b","ja":"みなさん、とても素敵です。\n私たちも、その声援に応えるぞ。","zh":"大家都很棒呢。\n我们也要回应这份声援呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d65b64edae461177e5c1232978b9a57477129a609dcf6d11ee299424e3b6b08b","ja":"（みんな、すごく堂々としてる。\n私も、もっと……！）","zh":"（大家都表现得非常堂堂正正。\n我也要更加……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"37ccd47e3c2fa75ce38b7452ff4cd34dd86e5d13395b7bf2ce14c2d4b1ef36f7","ja":"わ、私、精一杯、歌って踊りますから……\nみなさんも、付いてきてくださ～いっ！","zh":"我、我会拼尽全力唱歌跳舞的……\n大家也一定要跟上哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1e2a9aed21b3e56894f776cabf82441572f73189d1b321ec562f707e0581688d","ja":"「ワアアアアアアッ！」","zh":"“哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f76d5507fb773cc450a5975710d7ef49d33f8063646fad9f341f8bd3f722bbe8","ja":"気持ちよかった～！\nみんな、めっちゃノッてくれたし♪","zh":"太痛快了～！\n大家也都超级嗨呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"5a6d5ae1f68a2bd59958e3d50fc2f128e9938fad4cb8cd76e64acb510c65fa43","ja":"ああ！　オレもすっげー、楽しかったよ♪","zh":"啊！我也超级开心的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"4810be6c975fba7a836c925141b4115d775abd1d32943d7def30aba9ca765fe1","ja":"……あ、兄ちゃんたちからまた連絡だ！\n「煽りにつられてめっちゃ声出した」だって！","zh":"……啊，哥哥他们又发来联络了！\n说是“被带起节奏跟着超大声地喊了”！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"75acf144bc8e4d1e50027e04400bc639d32d21abb800f36af997e7148ecc0f8b","ja":"兄ちゃんたちテンション上がって\n叫びまくってたもんな～！　へへっ、やったぜ♪","zh":"大哥哥们情绪都很高涨，\n叫个不停呢～！嘿嘿，太棒啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"1691432fd5501affe751d597a334537a92f2a90a7b100293d51313d6671d6969","ja":"おっ、私もアニキからや。なになに……\n「アイドルみたいにキラキラしとったで」","zh":"噢，我也收到我哥发来的了。写了什么呢……\n“像个偶像一样闪闪发光哦”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"65547890cb89c05e9d3cb9d9d66e80c63efa3b0a928907a784d6ba2fca4ec557","ja":"なんや照れるな～……って、\n私はほんまもんのアイドルやー！","zh":"怪让人不好意思的～……不对，\n我可是货真价实的偶像啊——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"50f3827d1baf723639b16737e7bb39077a15b645f4a9ba00ddf0b7146645f3da","ja":"私も今、父から連絡が来ました……\n「みんな、最後まで楽しんだそうだ」、と。いぇい。","zh":"我也刚收到父亲发来的联络……\n说是“大家好像都开心地享受到了最后”。耶。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"fda7a3878962f4315ce910a189ae7ca673db394c05609b5f19a923de474b1e7c","ja":"あ、お母さんから……！　「よく頑張ったね、\nみんなを笑顔にして、すごいね」って……！","zh":"啊，是妈妈发来的……！　上面说……\n“你真的很努力呢，把笑容带给大家，太棒了”……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"6dbb6ed8b4db7c27c8a4868ed4fdf843b241488a26ad9e3167f22da1e9615ff5","ja":"大絶賛ですね。\nゲリラライブ、大成功です。ぶい。","zh":"好评如潮呢。\n突击演出大获成功。耶。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1605.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"b80977c2f1b726bb93f91b0f255a3122790e5a5297e1bc632b399dbc52d6af2a","ja":"うん！　始まる前は、どうなるかと思ったけど、\nみんなに楽しんでもらえてよかった♪","zh":"嗯！开始之前我还担心会变成什么样呢，\n大家能玩得开心真是太好了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
